<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome!</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    h1 { color: #333; margin-top: 0; }
    p { color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #999; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome, <%= name %>! 🎉</h1>
    <p>Your account has been created successfully.</p>
    <p>Start adding your todos today. Log in and get organised!</p>
    <div class="footer">
      You are receiving this email because you just created an account. If this was not you, please ignore this email.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
